---
description: Produce actual scoped chat-continuity evidence for the outer coordinator.
args:
  goal: string
  previous: ChatInquiry | null
returns: ChatInquiry
uses: [workOnChatContinuity/workspace/discoverChatContinuity, workOnChatContinuity/chooseChatContinuity, workOnChatContinuity/workspace/observeChatContinuity, workOnChatContinuity/reviewChatContinuity]
---
Select the owned channel and acquire the observations needed by the actual continuity question. The catalog's original receipt/worker, a historical opening observation and current native state have distinct roles. A fixed two-read count is not evidence of those roles; preserve real earlier values when comparing or refining.

Use the installed conversation policy on actual native delivery/consumer/worker evidence. Return the index, plan, available observations and real review, with unavailable values null. Do not create messages, reactivate a worker, retain a note or declare the whole goal complete from this inquiry.

When continuing an investigation, preserve actual earlier observations from previous where their identity still matches this owned request. A fresh current read does not replace a historical opening or renew a grant. Use null for an initial inquiry, and pass actual prior inquiry values when refining rather than synthesizing them.
